Misho answered the whole morning list „ყველა კი" (11 Oct ~06:15 UTC,
recorded as §128 in ADMIN_WRITE_OPERATIONS). The three items already
built behind a switch go ON:

- BK (4555): MENTIONED_NOTE_LINE_ON — the owner's line after a value kept
  only as „mentioned".
- BL (4423): ANSWER_NOT_QUESTION_ON — an assistant-only answer to a
  helper's question is not sent while it is a question.
- BN (3731): RECOMMENDED_RELAY_ON — the recommended person is told who
  recommended her and what is needed.

Each test now pins the switch ON and the old behaviour when passed off.

